+
+The built DLL's exact embedded resource passed `../verify_oneup_embedded_bundle.py`, recorded in `../throwdown-logo-size-embedded-check.log`. The installed DLL SHA-256 is `10a63b3d0498ed8678d9c939c81da2fd5f5a989c17502fdd1ac00512ea0ce2a4`; the unchanged launcher is `8972ca40c9da4d30a3b35bdf8457150c5b1c5931c4d81a61c4fea49af900ceaf`. The previous DLL and launcher were hash-verified in `E:/Games/ReSkate/ReSkate-OneUp-backups/native-throwdowns-ad2b01d36f0a46f99d6fc51bce917091` before deployment. The game was restarted normally, without automatic challenge commands or computer input. The existing eleven rule/lifetime regression checks from the prior build were not rerun for this asset-frame-only change.
+
+The restarted game remained responsive and mounted the patch successfully. The read-only resource check found `LogoTexture_Widget` and `LogoCaptionTile_Widget` loaded, along with the resolved grid and all nine private badge resources in two native resource lists. Evidence is saved in `../throwdown-logo-size-live-resources.log`. This confirms asset loading; the user performs the rendered picker check.
+
+## Transparent logo picker and diagonal names (2026-10-10)
+
+The user approved the full-size logo grid before requesting this presentation change. Keep its 4-by-3 grid, 424-by-424 cells, 32-pixel spacing, 320-by-320 logo models and private full-size native texture frames. Remove the visible cell backgrounds and caption bars; the cells remain input/layout regions only.
