+`throwdown_modes_ui.inl::picker_logo` now gives each tile a private copy of the native `TileButton.RoughPartial.NoDefaultBG` style. Its seven background states and three outline states all use that donor's native empty fill; rotation, inner shadow, drop shadow and content masking are disabled. The native button, pointer hit region, focus/input graph, stock navigation and nine independent custom callbacks stay intact. No shared ButtonStyle record is edited.
